KPL/IK

Hayabusa2 LIDAR Instrument kernel
==============================================================================

  This instrument kernel (I-kernel) file contains detector, optical, and
  field-of-view parameters for the Hayabusa2 LIDAR (Light Detection And
  Ranging) instrument.


